      "side": 1,
      "message": "Oh yes, I had forgotten about that. Good idea\n\n```\nif (!IS_ENABLED(STM32_USART_CR1_FIFOEN) || !(STM32_USART_SR(base) \u0026 STM32_USART_SR_TXE)) {\n   return;\n}\n```",
